                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "this game drained the liquid from my brain and drank it like coconut water while forcing me to do similar tedious things over and over and over again, but hey at least it was original\n\nPS. do NOT try to collect all the achievements in this game unless you want to grind days of your life away (billionare achievement requires at least 7 hours of copying, pasting, and breaking objects) and end up with your rarest achievement showcase filled with just LEGO Worlds because NO ONE plays this game for that long causing 50% of the achievements to be under 5% of players unlocked\n\nall and all game gets boring after 3 hours unless you're determined. definitely not worth the standard price, get it on sale",
